<title>USA: Omaha hogs traded $0.25 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs traded $0.25 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.25 lower. Top $52.75 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    230-260 lbs    52.50-52.75</p>
<p>Sow - 20 percent, not established.</p>
<p>Receipts - 600</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
